# Subbasin Group Definitions
# Allsubbasins: Subbasins utilized in calibration. Valid for TIME_CONC and TIME_TO_PEAK parameters.
# RiverChannelSubbasins: Subbasins with non-zero river length. Could be none. Valid for TIME_CONC and TIME_TO_PEAK parameters.
# LakeSubbasin_at_X and LakeSubbasin_Ungauged are mutually exclusive parameterization groups.
# ------------------------------------------------------------

